<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Cowen upgrades Compaq.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Cowen upgrades Compaq.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Cowen &amp; Co analyst Richard Chu said he boosted his rating on Compaq Computer Corp to strong buy from buy and raised his earnings estimates on the computer maker for 1997 and 1998.</p>
<p>-- The analyst said he raised his 1997 earings estimate to $6.10 per share from $6.00 and lifted his 1998 view to $7.50 per share from $7.00 previously.</p>
<p>-- He said he put a 12-month target price of $110 on the stock. The previous price target was not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Compaq shares closed at 79-3/4 Friday.</p>
<p>((-- E. Auchard, Wall Street bureau, 212-859-1736))</p>
</text>
